  "_comment": "Editable, deterministic keyword rules for naming Apple Store orders, iPhone, MacBook Air, Magic Keyboard. An order is named for its main product from significant_items, and when two keywords match the longer one wins, so Magic Keyboard for iPad Pro is a Magic Keyboard. Keywords match case-insensitively, phrases as phrases, and a short single word only as a whole word. An order nothing here names falls back to the categories, and one that matches nothing is left for review-names. App Store purchases do not use this file, Apple names what was bought and apple_site.py reads it from there. Edit freely, no code changes needed.",
